                    insight_coalition:      `Your coalition stayed weak. One non-incumbent rarely moves a regulator; leading or joining a credible coalition — without a toxic partner — is how the ask gains weight.`,
                    insight_jointly:        `You optimised the four interdependent KPIs jointly rather than trading one for another — the precise skill the simulation drills: outcome, legitimacy, coalition and reputation moving together.`,

